 713:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****   /* The function is internally
 714:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****    * divided into three stages according to the number of multiplications that has to be
 715:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****    * taken place between inputA samples and inputB samples. In the first stage of the
 716:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****    * algorithm, the multiplications increase by one for every iteration.
 717:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****    * In the second stage of the algorithm, srcBLen number of multiplications are done.
 718:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****    * In the third stage of the algorithm, the multiplications decrease by one
 719:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****    * for every iteration. */
 720:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c **** 
 721:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_conv_fast_q15.c ****   /* The algorithm is implemented in three stages.
